    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on darwin1859-ch13-03: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.60";
    dc:description "Constancy and phylogenetic utility can be quantified, but adaptation involvement requires expert annotation. Existing data support focused clades rather than animals and plants generally.";
