    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Across annotated morphological characters, test whether characters with weaker ecological or functional association have lower evolutionary transition rates and greater congruence with independently inferred molecular trees. The predicted joint pattern supports the claim.";
